Did you forget any supplies?

There are some Royal Shamans and Royal Mages on the Shadow Road. They can help you.

Do not forget to install the C-stone; only then will we have the information we need about the Shadow Dimension.

A light on the ground marks the right place to install the C-stone. It is in your quest inventory.

We are counting on you!

When you are done, come talk to me again.
